Package: processpredictR
Type: Package
Title: Process Prediction
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c(person("Ivan","Esin", email =
        "ivan.esin@student.uhasselt", role ="aut"),
        person("Gert","Janssenswillen", email =
        "gert.janssenswillen@uhasselt.be", role = "cre"),
        person("Hasselt University", role = "cph"))
Description: Means to predict process flow, such as process outcome,
        next activity, next time, remaining time, and remaining trace.
        Off-the-shelf predictive models based on the concept of
        Transformers are provided, as well as multiple way to customize
        the models. This package is partly based on work described in
        Zaharah A. Bukhsh, Aaqib Saeed, & Remco M. Dijkman. (2021).
        "ProcessTransformer: Predictive Business Process Monitoring
        with Transformer Network" <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2104.00721>.
